      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "69865040929d9f325b47ae0c",
      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Open the big worlds list\n\n2. Open any category with a lot of items (so any public list aside from vrcat's variety box and featured sections)\n\n3. Scroll for a while\n\nPeriodically, when a list hits certain points (these can take a bit) the menu items will shift around as pages are loaded/unloaded from the UI - it seems it doesn't align with the scroll correctly, and sometimes not even with the 4-column layout, leading to shifting and gaps at the bottom at various points in scroll.\n\nThis has been a bug for a while, and it's somewhat consistent. It's not specific to the beta.\n\nIt may affect other platforms than PC, but I have only tested on PC.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1650] Scrolling worlds sometimes jumps around",
