  "details": "Scrollbar glitches/jumps/jitters when pulled with cursor/arrows/W&S in Desktop and VR\n\nIt can be seen best on a long \"Friend Locations\" list. I have often about 25+ locations of friends. It can also be seen on the Avatars Pages. ANd on Profiles, but there it's less noticable. example:\n\n* https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_b231cc91-30ea-4181-8ae6-d7dd85794120\n\nSimilar Tickets:\n\n* https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/jittery-scrolling-in-social-friend-locations-tab\n\n* https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1695-friend-locations-in-socials-glitches-out-when-scrolling-to-friends-in-priva\n\n* https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/scroll-bar-in-menu-glitchy-when-you-click-it",
